e the full\nWindows shell context menu (right-click), or drag them into other applications.\n\nWorks with local folders as well as cloud-synced folders such as OneDrive,\nDropbox and Google Drive — always showing the latest files.\n\nKey features:\n- Multiple animation styles: Fan, Glide, Spring, Fade or None.\n- Sort by date modified, date created or name, with optional filename regex filter.\n- Configurable item count, folder path and display options via tray menu or registry.\n- Full Windows shell context menu and drag-and-drop support.\n- Per-user MSI install, no admin rights required.\n- Native x64 and ARM64 builds.\n- Small footprint and low memory usage.","moniker":"fanfolder","name":"FanFolder","packageUrl":"https://github.com/olebhartvigsen/FanFolder","publisher":"Ole Bhartvigsen","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/olebhartvigsen","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/olebhartvigsen/FanFolder/releases/tag/v1.2.2","tags":["taskbar","productivity","launcher","fan","folder","utility","shell","files"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://github.com/olebhartvigsen","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/olebhartvigsen/FanFolder/releases/tag/v1.2.2","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.9.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/o/OleBhartvigsen/FanFolder/1.2.2/OleBhartvigsen.FanFolder.yaml","sha256":"2d7675d8577e06510ff3c80e81a760548930dd7b87d425b3760c40ff6acf32cb"},{"path":"manifests/o/OleBhartvigsen/FanFolder/1.2.2/OleBhartvigsen.FanFolder.installer.yaml","sha256":"5df0c6eecbc0de5402508ce863244dd7d3170403d0dfa06f547e3b386cf7d69c"},{"path":"manifests/o/OleBhartvigsen/FanFolder/1.2.2/OleBhartvigsen.FanFolder.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"8a4efb955131d8a15548be231d20bb42dbb2ccaa59bb94f3b1a67cd55c7d595d"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"1.2.2"}